{
  "family": "Segoe UI GO",
  "source": {
    "kind": "hmtx",
    "date": "2026-10-29",
    "fonts": [
      "Segoe UI (Office CloudFonts cache: Regular, Bold, Italic, Bold Italic)",
      "Helvetica (macOS Helvetica.ttc)"
    ],
    "probe": "hmtx advance-ratio buckets (<= 1.5 % span, build-font-aliases.mjs --refit-buckets); Word lays the cloud face out at its own advances"
  },
  "refit": {
    "method": "hmtx-buckets",
    "span": 0.015,
    "range": "U+0020-007E, U+00A0-00FF, U+2013-2015, U+2017-201E, U+2020-2022, U+2026, U+20AC",
    "cuts": {
      "normal/normal": {
        "word": "cloud:Segoe UI/Segoe UI",
        "base": "system:/System/Library/Fonts/Helvetica.ttc#0",
        "src": "local('Helvetica'), local('ArialMT'), url('./LiberationSans-Regular.ttf')"
      },
      "bold/normal": {
        "word": "cloud:Segoe UI/Segoe UI Bold",
        "base": "system:/System/Library/Fonts/Helvetica.ttc#1",
        "src": "local('Helvetica-Bold'), local('Arial-BoldMT'), url('./LiberationSans-Bold.ttf')"
      },
      "normal/italic": {
        "word": "cloud:Segoe UI/Segoe UI Italic",
        "base": "system:/System/Library/Fonts/Helvetica.ttc#2",
        "src": "local('Helvetica-Oblique'), local('Arial-ItalicMT'), url('./LiberationSans-Italic.ttf')"
      },
      "bold/italic": {
        "word": "cloud:Segoe UI/Segoe UI Bold Italic",
        "base": "system:/System/Library/Fonts/Helvetica.ttc#3",
        "src": "local('Helvetica-BoldOblique'), local('Arial-BoldItalicMT'), url('./LiberationSans-BoldItalic.ttf')"
      }
    }
  },
  "note": "Segoe UI is an M365 cloud font Word downloads and renders real; where it is\nnot installed Chromium falls to Helvetica/Arial, whose letters run wider.\nWhole-face ratios (shaped widths of a long body per cut, 2026-09-11: 0.986\nregular, 0.987 bold) still moved a wrap every few lines on English body text\n(validation corpus 2026-10-29: 14 Segoe UI documents at 5.2 % mean deviation);\nthe faces are now advance-ratio buckets over Helvetica (Word advance / Helvetica\nadvance per Latin-1 glyph, greedy buckets no wider than 1.5 %, one size-adjusted\nface per bucket with an explicit unicode-range, the rangeless face at the median\nlowercase ratio). An installed Segoe UI precedes this alias in the chain.",
